#: energy.cpp:145
msgid ""
"<h1>Display Power Control</h1> If your display supports power saving features, "
"you can configure them using this module."
"<p> There are three levels of power saving: standby, suspend, and off. The "
"greater the level of power saving, the longer it takes for the display to "
"return to an active state."
"<p> To wake up the display from a power saving mode, you can make a small "
"movement with the mouse, or press a key that is not likely to cause any "
"unintentional side-effects, for example, the \"Shift\" key."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Küräk Qüäten Caylaw</h1> Biredäge küräk üz qüät qullanuın kimetä alsa, ul "
"çaqta anı bu modul aşa köyläp bula."
"<p> Qüät saqlawnıñ öç basqıçı bar: kötep, yoqlap, sünderep toru. Süngän kileş "
"torğanda küräk alğan qüät iñ kime bula, läkin eşkä qabızılu da ozağraq bula."
"<p> Alğan qüäten saqlaw xälendä torğan küräkne uyatu öçen küsene qımşatu da "
"citä, yä ki \"Shift\" kebek bernigä dä kitermi torğan töymägä basıp bula."

#: energy.cpp:165
msgid "&Enable display power management"
msgstr "&Küräkneñ qüät alu citäkläwen qullanası"

#: energy.cpp:168
msgid "Check this option to enable the power saving features of your display."
msgstr "Bu köylämä yanıq itep, küräkneñ qüät saqlawın qullanırğa bulaçaq."

#: energy.cpp:171
msgid "Your display does not support power saving."
msgstr "Bu küräk qüätne saqlí almí."

#: energy.cpp:178
msgid "Learn more about the Energy Star program"
msgstr "Energy Star programı turında kübrägen belü"

#: energy.cpp:187
msgid "&Standby after:"
msgstr "&Bonnan soñ kütäse:"

#: energy.cpp:189 energy.cpp:200 energy.cpp:212
msgid " min"
msgstr " min"

#: energy.cpp:190 energy.cpp:201 energy.cpp:213
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Sünek"

#: energy.cpp:193
msgid ""
"Choose the period of inactivity after which the display should enter "
"\"standby\" mode. This is the first level of power saving."
msgstr ""
"Küräkneñ kötep turı ısulına kergänçe eşsez toru arasın saylaw. Qüät saqlawınıñ "
"berençe basqıçı bu."

#: energy.cpp:198
msgid "S&uspend after:"
msgstr "T&uqtap toruğa ara:"

#: energy.cpp:204
msgid ""
"Choose the period of inactivity after which the display should enter "
"\"suspend\" mode. This is the second level of power saving, but may not be "
"different from the first level for some displays."
msgstr ""
"Küräkneñ yoqlap turı ısulına kergänçe eşsez toru arasın saylaw. Qüät saqlawınıñ "
"ikençe basqıçı bu, alay bulsa da qayber küräklärdä berençe basqıç belän ikençe "
"arasında ayırma yuq."

#: energy.cpp:210
msgid "&Power off after:"
msgstr "&Monnan soñ sünder:"

#: energy.cpp:216
msgid ""
"Choose the period of inactivity after which the display should be powered off. "
"This is the greatest level of power saving that can be achieved while the "
"display is still physically turned on."
msgstr ""
"Küräk sünderelgän bulğançı eşsez toru arasın saylaw. Qüät saqlawınıñ iñ öste "
"basqıçı bu, çönki ul çaqta küräk bötenläy sünä."
